docs/paper/experiments.tex:32:Two additional seeds under identical conditions fail to converge ($\text{PR}{\approx}14\%$; Appendix~\ref{app:seed-convergence}), retaining genuine reasoning and confirming that structural degeneration requires successful RL optimization as a prerequisite (Appendix~\ref{app:llama-coldstart}).
docs/paper/appendix.tex:739:\label{app:seed-convergence}
docs/paper/appendix.tex:789:This result mirrors two other non-convergence cases: (1)~the seed-dependent 4B non-convergence (s45, s52; Appendix~\ref{app:seed-convergence}), where identical 4B configurations fail to bootstrap, and (2)~the LLaMA-3.2-3B cold-start failure (Appendix~\ref{app:llama-coldstart}), where the base model lacks FOL generation capability entirely.
